{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog","id":1273203,"title":"Dante's Ascension Blog?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-06T22:04:53-08:00","id":1273203,"title":"Dante's Ascension Blog?","content":"Would you be interested in something for M5 along the lines of <i>Beckett's Jyhad Diary</i>? That is, an supplement that is both in character and out of character (mostly providing plot hooks), and discusses the movement of the timeline and metaplot from the old books to M5. I'm calling it <i>Dante's Ascension Blog</i> as a joke. It probably would not be Dante, but some other NPC. In any case, how do you feel about the basic concept?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T22:12:04-08:00","id":1273206,"title":"","content":"Yes. I'd like to see a thorough list of all the threads open in the metaplot. I think Dante would be a shitty character as, well, with Correspondence 6 you just kind of know everything happening. I'd put forward Amanda Jonsson or another servant of Sennex or maybe a person for each faction at least among the Nephandi, Traditions, Marauders, Disparates and maybe &quot;other&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-07T05:17:06-08:00","id":1273247,"title":"","content":"What about John Courage? He seems the kind of guy that would make a conspiracy diary and have half reliable data of what's happening in the various fronts of the War","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-07T08:12:02-08:00","id":1273263,"title":"","content":"Courage is a good one, and Dante's a spirit creature now in any case. I was actually thinking of an Orphan, someone who is not nuetral, but is also not tied ideologically to any Tradition or Convention.<br /> <br /> But, the central idea of a book to move the time line up is solid? I like the idea, but that doesn't mean much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-07T08:58:53-08:00","id":1273268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273263#post1273263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But, the central idea of a book to move the time line up is solid?</div> </div> </div> </div> <img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/eswikia/images/1/12/Thumbs_up_1.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20100606105501\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Sure, why not?.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T00:10:58-08:00","id":1273404,"title":"","content":"I think it would be interesting if such a book would be written from the perspective of a pair of Mages, a Traditions Mage and a Technocrat working together or in parallel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T05:45:26-08:00","id":1273422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273404#post1273404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it would be interesting if such a book would be written from the perspective of a pair of Mages, a Traditions Mage and a Technocrat working together or in parallel.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooooh. This could be pleasing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T06:44:16-08:00","id":1273428,"title":"","content":"Personally though, I don't really want any major setting changes in M5, if it happens. The current &quot;extended Revised&quot; set-up is pretty fine for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T07:05:55-08:00","id":1273432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PhillyCuriosity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273422#post1273422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ooooh. This could be pleasing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine it being written in a way that would emphasize and define both the similarities and the differences between Mystic Mages and Technocrats. In regard to the similiarities - the book could underline how Mystics and Technocrats not only can have shared goals or perspectives, but that they can also be very similar and comparable in regard to traits and qualities that they have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T08:28:02-08:00","id":1273442,"title":"","content":"It could be a race between the Tradition character, and the Technocrat character, both seeking the same thing. I don't know what the McGuffin would be - maybe discovering the fate of mages trapped in the Umbra by the Avatar Storm. The fact the players know what happened doesn't mean the NPCs know. In any case, that would serve to set the characters and the plot into motion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T11:06:16-08:00","id":1273469,"title":"","content":"So, what hanging plot threads are there from Revised?<br /> <br /> *Ongoing turmoil within the Technocracy, NWO vs Syndicate and idealists vs hardliners<br /> *Voormas - resolved in <i>Ascension</i>, but that's non-canon these days<br /> *Disparates and their belief that both factions have been taken over by the Nephandi<br /> *Threat Null, looming over in the Umbra and threatening to invade Earth<br /> *The birth of the New Horizon Council to lead the Traditions<br /> <br /> Did I miss anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T15:26:42-08:00","id":1273505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Czernobog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273469#post1273469\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Did I miss anything?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> -The Void Engineer are the cause for the ongoing Avatar Storm, they use tools offered to them by one of the last chrononauts (the one who leaked info on the Cop and darkside base to the traditions in the book of worlds) to maintain it as a shield agaisnt Threat Null and other invading forces.(Void engineer revised)<br /> -The Progenitors apparently found a way to identify nephandi even amongs their ranks.(Progenitor revised)<br /> -Iteration X is secretly (or they think they're doing it secretly but anyone in the technocracy knows something is off) building a Computer 2.0, that's not the secret part, that would be their attempt to nervously hide massive ammount of data in the digital web, probably linked to their new overlord.(Progenitor and Void engineer revised).<br /> <br /> -(From the M20 cookbook) The narrator mention an oingoing alliance of ameridian medicine men with the Dreamspeaker, to the point that the narrator suspect it might lead to the birth of a whole new faction.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T19:03:59-08:00","id":1273534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273505#post1273505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">.(Void engineer revised).</div> </div> </div> </div>Are the revised Convention books worth getting?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273505#post1273505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-(From the M20 cookbook) The narrator mention an oingoing alliance of ameridian medicine men with the Dreamspeaker, to the point that the narrator suspect it might lead to the birth of a whole new faction.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder if that even counts as &quot;meta-plot.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T02:24:24-08:00","id":1273567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273534#post1273534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are the revised Convention books worth getting?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, they present the Conventions in a more positive light without really whitewashing them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T20:44:42-08:00","id":1273654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273534#post1273534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are the revised Convention books worth getting?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>For all the &quot;Technocracy represents Stasis&quot; they are perhaps the organization that is most effected and transformed by the changes in modern culture. The prerevised Technocracy books come at them from a perspective on technology and culture that predates you know the smartphone and major aspects of social Media.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T12:49:02-08:00","id":1273775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1273534#post1273534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are the revised Convention books worth getting?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yuuuup. The Revised convention books tackle things like the following (some may also be in Guide to the Technocracy but I don't specifically recall):<br /> <br /> Growing war between Syndicate and NWO and everyone else<br /> The weird phenomenon where mundane astronomers don't see stuff clearly<br /> Threat Null &lt;------- that's a two-seater on the ol' metaplot bus<br /> Iteration X dealing with being cut off from The Computer<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T11:41:32-08:00","id":1274745,"title":"","content":"I wish a new Iteration-X Convention Book would be written, as the current revised one was written a decade before the four other revised CBs ( By this, I don't mean to say that the revised Iteration-X CB is bad. ) . But then, what would the other Conventions get if Iteration-X gets another book ? Still, I think it should be done, even if it will result in inequality in the amount of material. The Iteration-X is in some respects the principal Convention of the Technocracy, so I think it does deserve a CB written in the new style and outlook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T14:25:24-08:00","id":1274775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1273203-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1274745#post1274745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wish a new Iteration-X Convention Book would be written, as the current revised one was written a decade before the four other revised CBs ( By this, I don't mean to say that the revised Iteration-X CB is bad. ) . But then, what would the other Conventions get if Iteration-X gets another book ? Still, I think it should be done, even if it will result in inequality in the amount of material. The Iteration-X is in some respects the principal Convention of the Technocracy, so I think it does deserve a CB written in the new style and outlook.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not to mention that it completely removed any degree of darkness or flaw from Iteration X - they definitely needed a change from their Skynet/Borg/THX-1138 presentation in their first book* to be playable (and to fit with the overall shift in portrayal the Technocracy went through) but it went a bit <i>too </i>far. And the complete lack of rotes.<br /> <br /> *Which, BTW, was retconned to be Traditions propaganda.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1410,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","user":"Czernobog","date":". 12-16-2018, 05:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}